{"date":"2026-10-17","generated_at":"2026-10-17T08:05+08:00","x_calls":20,"source_note":"数据来自 X 公开接口；热度为抓取时的数字，之后会继续变化。摘要由助手根据帖子和 X 热点汇总改写成中文。","categories":[{"id":"postable","name":"今天能拿去发的","icon":"✍️","items":[{"title":"纽约报告：AI 最能干的岗位，新人招聘少了四成","summary":"纽约市一份报告统计，自 ChatGPT 推出后，设计、媒体和写作类入门岗位招聘降了 40.6%，客服降了 34.4%。你可以说：最先被挤掉的不是老师傅，是刚入门的人；我晚上学 AI，就是不想等它来挤我。","post":{"id":"2111058825453208037","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2111058825453208037","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:37+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":345961,"likes":3453,"reposts":412,"replies":194},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2111115992453750942","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111115992453750942"}},{"title":"面试官问：AI 都会写代码了，凭什么要你？","summary":"一条只有一个问题的帖子：面试官问“Claude Code 已经能写代码了，我们为什么要雇你？”，20 万浏览，很多人在回复里给答案。你可以说：换成做生意的，问题就是“AI 都能做了，客人凭什么找你”；我的答案是：我懂客人，还能把事办成。","post":{"id":"2110977036361556452","url":"https://x.com/Denche2005/status/2110977036361556452","author":"Denche2005","author_name":"Denys Cherednychenko","created_at":"2026-10-16T14:12+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":200355,"likes":869,"reposts":15,"replies":606},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111090552129388560","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111090552129388560"}},{"title":"奥特曼自己承认：AI 改变世界没他想的那么快","summary":"中文博主转述：OpenAI 老板山姆·奥特曼在采访里承认，原以为 2023 年 GPT-4 出来后软件行业很快洗牌，结果没那么快，他说是经济的惯性太大。你可以说：AI 没有一夜改变世界，正好给我们普通人留了学的时间。","post":{"id":"2111047793183973744","url":"https://x.com/lxfater/status/2111047793183973744","author":"lxfater","author_name":"铁锤人","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:53+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":10482,"likes":26,"reposts":3,"replies":27},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2111074178766090411","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111074178766090411"}}]},{"id":"musk","name":"马斯克今天在干嘛","icon":"🚀","items":[{"title":"马斯克：原来未来真有会飞的车","summary":"特斯拉 10 月 15 日在得州 SpaceX 场地展示新跑车 Roadster 原型：在弯道上倒着开、用冷气推进器在空中翻转再落地。据 X 热点汇总，量产计划在 2028 年。马斯克发帖说“未来真有会飞的车”。","post":{"id":"2110913107094606330","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110913107094606330","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-16T09:57+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":56698404,"likes":723411,"reposts":86604,"replies":37216},"flag":"据X热点汇总","story":{"id":"2111216662753968611","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111216662753968611"}},{"title":"马斯克：X 上的广告以后要过“审美关”","summary":"马斯克宣布：以后 X 上的广告都要符合“合理的审美标准”，难看、刺耳、尖叫式或夸大产品效果的广告主会被禁止投放。之后他又让大家把难看或误导的广告举报给 X 广告团队。","post":{"id":"2111131160348688395","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111131160348688395","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:24+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":4769935,"likes":141269,"reposts":8921,"replies":6433},"flag":"本人说法"},{"title":"星链在乌克兰被限速？泽连斯基回应","summary":"据 X 热点汇总，有报道称美国官员下令限制乌克兰军队用的星链军用版“星盾”网速。泽连斯基发帖说，乌克兰不是用星链打进俄罗斯，而是用来拦截袭击平民的无人机。","post":{"id":"2111128466598854924","url":"https://x.com/ZelenskyyUa/status/2111128466598854924","author":"ZelenskyyUa","author_name":"Volodymyr Zelenskyy / Володимир Зеленський","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:13+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1736216,"likes":52473,"reposts":9087,"replies":1880},"flag":"各执一词","story":{"id":"2110940827413307427","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110940827413307427"}},{"title":"马斯克 9 月砸 1.58 亿美元支持得州参议员选举","summary":"美国有线电视新闻网 CNN 报道，据联邦选举委员会新文件，马斯克 9 月向一个共和党基金捐了 1.58 亿美元，钱随后转去支持得州共和党人帕克斯顿竞选参议员。","post":{"id":"2111026882959286396","url":"https://x.com/CNN/status/2111026882959286396","author":"CNN","author_name":"CNN","created_at":"2026-10-16T17:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1513252,"likes":4204,"reposts":1610,"replies":1703},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2111065293632225664","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111065293632225664"}},{"title":"特斯拉辅助驾驶在斯洛伐克获批","summary":"马斯克转发：特斯拉需要人看着的“监督版”自动驾驶已在欧洲国家斯洛伐克获批，很快开始推送。","post":{"id":"2111131436191199660","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111131436191199660","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:25+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1332561,"likes":17900,"reposts":1442,"replies":968},"flag":"公司自述"},{"title":"美国西南航空全部飞机要装星链上网","summary":"马斯克转发消息：美国西南航空宣布，到 2027 年秋天全部飞机都会装上星链卫星上网。马斯克说他们这是“全力押注星链”。","post":{"id":"2111135753732301178","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111135753732301178","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:42+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1126216,"likes":16411,"reposts":1512,"replies":971},"flag":"公司自述"},{"title":"特斯拉和 SpaceX 会合并吗？押注升到六成","summary":"马斯克发了一句“Tesla x SpaceX”，合并话题又热了。预测市场 Kalshi 显示一年内合并的概率升到 60%，创新高；据 X 热点汇总，巴克莱分析师预计可能在 12 月 6 日前的特斯拉股东会前宣布。","post":{"id":"2111101155640045574","url":"https://x.com/Kalshi/status/2111101155640045574","author":"Kalshi","author_name":"Kalshi","created_at":"2026-10-16T22:25+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1101671,"likes":650,"reposts":44,"replies":63},"flag":"传闻","story":{"id":"2110621202922238247","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110621202922238247"}}]},{"id":"ai","name":"AI 大事","icon":"🤖","items":[{"title":"谷歌 Gemini 4 Argon 开放给付费用户","summary":"谷歌 Antigravity 官方说，Gemini 4 Argon 今天开放给付费的 Google AI Pro 订阅用户，因为需求太大，每周有用量上限。","post":{"id":"2110866531932316011","url":"https://x.com/antigravity/status/2110866531932316011","author":"antigravity","author_name":"Google Antigravity","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:52+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1256414,"likes":14422,"reposts":1278,"replies":941},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110279138858946570","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110279138858946570"}},{"title":"Claude Opus 5.5 “快速模式”对所有开发者开放","summary":"Anthropic 官方宣布：Opus 5.5 快速模式结束测试、取消排队名单，同一个模型输出最快快 2.5 倍。据 X 热点汇总，价格是普通版的两倍左右。普通用户用不上，主要给开发者。","post":{"id":"2110825294655562048","url":"https://x.com/ClaudeDevs/status/2110825294655562048","author":"ClaudeDevs","author_name":"ClaudeDevs","created_at":"2026-10-16T04:09+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":775602,"likes":6600,"reposts":241,"replies":294},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110914330774688202","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110914330774688202"}},{"title":"纽约市审计官要求 Anthropic 推迟上市","summary":"财经快讯号称，纽约市审计官莱文以 AI 安全为由，呼吁 Anthropic 推迟大规模上市，Anthropic 已经和他开始沟通。","post":{"id":"2111098133014839624","url":"https://x.com/DeItaone/status/2111098133014839624","author":"DeItaone","author_name":"*Walter Bloomberg","created_at":"2026-10-16T22:13+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":426623,"likes":838,"reposts":106,"replies":144},"flag":"媒体报道","story":{"id":"2110778186846044614","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110778186846044614"}},{"title":"Opus 5.5 发布快一个月，还被说是最强","summary":"不少 AI 圈博主把 Anthropic 的 Claude Opus 5.5 排在第一档，有人说“现在没有比它更好的模型”，有人说从别家换过来像从安卓换到苹果。谷歌那边也有人不服。","post":{"id":"2111005536284250169","url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2111005536284250169","author":"kimmonismus","author_name":"Chubby♨️","created_at":"2026-10-16T16:05+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":65386,"likes":2374,"reposts":58,"replies":162},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111045165691425259","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111045165691425259"}},{"title":"调查：过半 Anthropic 员工看好 AI 出诺奖成果","summary":"Anthropic 调查了 1 万多名美国成年人和自家员工。博主整理：超过一半员工认为 2027 年前 AI 能做出诺贝尔奖级别的发现，普通美国人的预期低很多。","post":{"id":"2111200879345127489","url":"https://x.com/scaling01/status/2111200879345127489","author":"scaling01","author_name":"Lisan al Gaib","created_at":"2026-10-17T05:01+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":25735,"likes":433,"reposts":13,"replies":11},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111232636878266782","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111232636878266782"}}]},{"id":"ai_money","name":"AI 赚钱思路/副业案例","icon":"💡","items":[{"title":"美国银行警告：AI 热有点像历史上的泡沫","summary":"美国银行策略师警告，AI 投资热开始像典型的“先猛涨后崩盘”周期：花钱暴增、产能堆积。据 X 热点汇总，大科技公司资本开支预测从 3300 亿美元涨到 1 万亿美元。","post":{"id":"2111159236986036491","url":"https://x.com/unusual_whales/status/2111159236986036491","author":"unusual_whales","author_name":"unusual_whales","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:16+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":787125,"likes":9660,"reposts":845,"replies":330},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111163523803885953","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111163523803885953"}},{"title":"传一只押注 AI 股的对冲基金爆仓","summary":"网上传言押注 AI 基础设施股票的 VARA AI 基金已经爆仓。据 X 热点汇总，它 7 月跌过 44%。目前只是传言，没有官方确认。","post":{"id":"2110757387984597242","url":"https://x.com/MartinShkreli/status/2110757387984597242","author":"MartinShkreli","author_name":"Martin Shkreli","created_at":"2026-10-15T23:39+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":722360,"likes":3083,"reposts":192,"replies":128},"flag":"传闻","story":{"id":"2110781575944110288","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110781575944110288"}},{"title":"美国八成风投的钱流向了 AI 公司","summary":"今年前 9 个月，美国约 83% 的风险投资给了 AI 公司。投资人查马斯说，他怀疑 AI 公司 70% 到 80% 的收入，来自其他拿了风投钱的 AI 公司。","post":{"id":"2110865418416177457","url":"https://x.com/chamath/status/2110865418416177457","author":"chamath","author_name":"Chamath Palihapitiya","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:48+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":210225,"likes":1268,"reposts":122,"replies":201},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110938595716472946","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110938595716472946"}},{"title":"台积电三季度收入 467 亿美元，同比涨 41%","summary":"台积电公布三季度收入 467.2 亿美元，比去年同期涨 41.2%，超过预期。据 X 热点汇总，高性能计算（主要是 AI 芯片）占了收入的 68%。","post":{"id":"2110617288332234997","url":"https://x.com/wallstengine/status/2110617288332234997","author":"wallstengine","author_name":"Wall St Engine","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:22+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":144223,"likes":1125,"reposts":190,"replies":32},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2110560736464527748","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110560736464527748"}},{"title":"被 AI 公司高薪挖走，月薪被砍到三分之一","summary":"尼日利亚一位营销负责人分享：被一家 AI 创业公司以月薪 300 万奈拉挖走，结果没预算、项目停滞，工资被砍到 100 万奈拉。提醒：别光看 AI 公司画的饼。","post":{"id":"2111131169873867134","url":"https://x.com/OpeyemiDrift/status/2111131169873867134","author":"OpeyemiDrift","author_name":"Opeyemi","created_at":"2026-10-17T00:24+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":138517,"likes":1437,"reposts":271,"replies":204},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2111202718047965566","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111202718047965566"}}]},{"id":"grok","name":"Grok Bot 使用小技巧","icon":"🛠️","items":[{"title":"马斯克：在做给企业用的“砍价 Bot”","summary":"马斯克说，团队在下大力气做企业版“砍价 Bot”（Hagglebot），认为能让企业成本效率提高 5% 以上。据 X 热点汇总，Grok Bot 模板市场里已有砍价类模板。","post":{"id":"2111161779657285919","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111161779657285919","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:26+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":898870,"likes":5694,"reposts":405,"replies":445},"flag":"本人说法","story":{"id":"2110732846352544080","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110732846352544080"}},{"title":"Grok Bot 变快了：电脑任务平均快 3 倍","summary":"马斯克转发并说 Grok Bot 快多了。被转的帖子说：Grok Bot 做电脑上的任务平均快 3 倍，其他回复的等待时间不到原来一半。","post":{"id":"2111239586873745604","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111239586873745604","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T07:35+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":431296,"likes":1939,"reposts":193,"replies":499},"flag":"公司自述"},{"title":"Grok Bot 模板市场：一键导入官方现成的 Bot","summary":"博主发现，Grok Bot 团队把自己内部用的 Bot 模板放进了市场，可以直接导入为某个具体工作配好的一整套设置，不用从零教。","post":{"id":"2111074067461611540","url":"https://x.com/monokern/status/2111074067461611540","author":"monokern","author_name":"monokern","created_at":"2026-10-16T20:37+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":421335,"likes":2300,"reposts":286,"replies":155},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110732846352544080","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110732846352544080"}},{"title":"小技巧：语音换成 Ara，调快一点听","summary":"有网友建议把 Grok Bot 的语音换成 Ara、用 1.25 倍速；马斯克回复说他自己就这么用，不过开 1.5 倍速。","post":{"id":"2111238267878449283","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111238267878449283","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T07:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":412995,"likes":1853,"reposts":162,"replies":504},"flag":"个人分享"},{"title":"马斯克：把 Grok Bot 接到你的 X 私信最好用","summary":"马斯克建议让 Grok Bot 连上你的 X 私信，说这是“最好用的方式”。他转发的帖子说，和 Grok Bot 语音通话更快、更稳，也更记得以前聊过什么。","post":{"id":"2111239205951086616","url":"https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2111239205951086616","author":"elonmusk","author_name":"Elon Musk","created_at":"2026-10-17T07:33+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":374312,"likes":1115,"reposts":154,"replies":278},"flag":"本人说法"},{"title":"Grok Bot 官方：聊天卡片换新设计","summary":"Grok Bot 官方账号说，这周改进了质量、细节和速度，聊天里的卡片换了更清爽的新设计。","post":{"id":"2111184270819803351","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2111184270819803351","author":"bot","author_name":"Grok Bot","created_at":"2026-10-17T03:55+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":297974,"likes":3714,"reposts":273,"replies":285},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111194155414364244","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111194155414364244"}}]},{"id":"self_up","name":"AI 时代怎么提升自己","icon":"📚","items":[{"title":"数学大神陶哲轩：数学的“英雄时代”要结束了","summary":"数学家陶哲轩说，我们正看到数学“浪漫的英雄时代”结束，进入“工业时代”。意思是以后靠 AI 和团队协作大批量出成果，不再只靠一个天才单打独斗。","post":{"id":"2110797855879471162","url":"https://x.com/haider1/status/2110797855879471162","author":"haider1","author_name":"Haider.","created_at":"2026-10-16T02:20+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":699918,"likes":4062,"reposts":472,"replies":225},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2111102733789106407","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111102733789106407"}},{"title":"AI 研究员：一对一 AI 辅导是教育最大的飞跃","summary":"AI 研究员肖莱说，一对一辅导一直是最好的教育方式，但以前太贵，会对话的 AI 能让每个人都有。建议：学东西时让 AI 当老师，多追问，少直接要答案。","post":{"id":"2110756584611516512","url":"https://x.com/fchollet/status/2110756584611516512","author":"fchollet","author_name":"François Chollet","created_at":"2026-10-15T23:36+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":71240,"likes":1258,"reposts":99,"replies":109},"flag":"观点","story":{"id":"2110411776726880393","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110411776726880393"}},{"title":"不少程序员因为 AI 很焦虑","summary":"一位技术博主说，他在会议上碰到很多开发者，对 AI 冲击自己的职业真的很沮丧、很担心。","post":{"id":"2111067793550647642","url":"https://x.com/housecor/status/2111067793550647642","author":"housecor","author_name":"Cory House","created_at":"2026-10-16T20:12+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":35474,"likes":438,"reposts":11,"replies":115},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2111102733789106407","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111102733789106407"}},{"title":"“AI 抢我饭碗，我咋反而更忙了？”","summary":"一位软件创业者晚上 10 点发帖：都说 AI 要抢软件工作，可他这辈子从没这么拼过。很多人回复说一样：AI 让活干得快了，但要管的事更多了。","post":{"id":"2110951609962545576","url":"https://x.com/nicbstme/status/2110951609962545576","author":"nicbstme","author_name":"Nicolas Bustamante","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":18907,"likes":196,"reposts":6,"replies":114},"flag":"个人分享","story":{"id":"2110980213031280644","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2110980213031280644"}},{"title":"Anthropic 数据：新招初级员工占比降到 9%","summary":"中文博主宝玉整理 Anthropic 10 月 16 日的报告：公司里 AI 助手的工作时长已是员工的 6 倍，技术岗新招人员里初级员工占比从 27% 降到 9%。","post":{"id":"2111223306061836484","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2111223306061836484","author":"dotey","author_name":"宝玉","created_at":"2026-10-17T06:30+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":6509,"likes":45,"reposts":10,"replies":28},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111232636878266782","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111232636878266782"}}]},{"id":"biz_ai","name":"实体老板的 AI 用法","icon":"🏭","items":[{"title":"波士顿动力老员工做出“毛绒陪伴机器人”","summary":"前波士顿动力高管创业，发布毛茸茸的两足机器人 Hugo。据 X 热点汇总，先给主题乐园和度假村用，做互动角色，不是干苦力的。","post":{"id":"2111124899788210639","url":"https://x.com/theermann/status/2111124899788210639","author":"theermann","author_name":"theermann","created_at":"2026-10-16T23:59+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":1271284,"likes":1318,"reposts":337,"replies":233},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111135168169730380","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111135168169730380"}},{"title":"中国公司推出 4 米高的工业人形机器人","summary":"预测市场账号 Polymarket 发消息：一家中国机器人公司发布 4 米高、约 1.2 吨的人形机器人，能举起 500 多公斤。据 X 热点汇总，主打矿山、港口、救灾这类危险重活。","post":{"id":"2111187674455499033","url":"https://x.com/Polymarket/status/2111187674455499033","author":"Polymarket","author_name":"Polymarket","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:09+08:00"},"metrics":{"views":136352,"likes":2813,"reposts":327,"replies":325},"flag":"公司自述","story":{"id":"2111200048826474878","url":"https://x.com/i/trending/2111200048826474878"}},{"title":"医疗账单公司让 AI 分析 20 年的理赔数据","summary":"一家 AI 服务商分享：投资方让他们在一家医疗账单公司里搭 AI 助手，直接分析真实理赔数据，数据留在公司自己的云上保密。思路：老数据也能交给 AI 分析，但要先管好隐私。","post":{"id":"2111042001827139833","url":"https://x.com/mardehay